         {
          "marks": [],
          "type": "text",
          "text": "When the frequency doubles, the period halves: 20 ms. The maximum value of the flux linkage does not change, but the same change takes place in half the time; the maximum rate of change of flux linkage, and therefore the peak emf, doubles: 12 V."
